**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Uu]serSettings/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/.tools/
**/.runtime/
**/.next/
**/node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/__pycache__/

*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
*.pyc
*.suo
*.user
*.csproj.user
